#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Cipluniau o'ch wyneb y mae Ubuntu Hello yn cymharu ag ef. Cadwch o leiaf "
"ddau, wedi'u cofnodi mewn gwahanol oleuadau."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Yn dangos modelau sydd wedi'u cadw ar gyfer:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Dim ond un model wyneb sydd wedi'i gofrestru. Mae sbectol, newid mewn blew "
"wyneb neu oleuo gwahanol yn newid sut mae'r camera'n gweld eich wyneb, felly "
"gall un model fethu (er enghraifft gyda'r nos o dan lampau). Ychwanegwch ail "
"fodel gyda sbectol neu hebddi, eich golwg arall, neu mewn golau gwahanol i "
"gadw datgloi'n ddibynadwy."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ychwanegu ail fodel"

