#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Mae hysbysiad bwrdd gwaith yn dangos tra bod Ubuntu Hello yn edrych am eich "
"wyneb, yna'n adrodd y canlyniad. Mae ymdrechion a fethwyd yn aros yn y "
"rhestr hysbysu."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Dangos hysbysiadau"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Un cerdyn fesul ymgais dilysu wyneb, wedi'i ddiweddaru yn ei le gyda'r "
"canlyniad."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Seiniau hysbysu"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr ""
"Chwarae sain y system ar gyfer ymgais gydnabyddedig neu ymgais aflwyddiannus."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Cynnwys diagnosteg"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ychwanegwch y model, sicrwydd vs. trothwy, fframiau, camera ac amseriad i "
"bob cerdyn. Defnyddiol wrth adrodd am broblem."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Diogelwch"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Pa mor agos y mae'n rhaid i'ch wyneb gyfateb, ac a yw Ubuntu Hello yn gofyn "
"i chi gadarnhau eich bod yno go iawn."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Llymder cydweddu wyneb"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cyflym"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Cytbwys"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Diogel"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Gofyn i mi amneidio i gadarnhau"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Ar ôl i'ch wyneb gyfateb, bydd hysbysiad yn gofyn i chi amneidio. Ni all "
"llun sy'n cael ei ddal o flaen y camera amneidio."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Cylch allweddi / KWallet Auto-Datgloi"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Galluogi dilysu wynebau i ddatgloi'ch cylch allweddi mewngofnodi yn "
"awtomatig neu KWallet wrth fewngofnodi. Mae hyn yn storio'ch cyfrinair "
"wedi'i selio yn y TPM yn ddiogel pan fydd ar gael, neu wedi'i amgryptio â "
"AES-256-GCM gan ddefnyddio allwedd feistr root yn unig. Setiau auth wyneb "
"PAM_AUTHTOK ar gyfer pam_gnome_keyring neu pam_kwallet5 yn dibynnu ar eich "
"bwrdd gwaith."

